lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软曝光纯网页版操作系统Project Aion，彻底放弃原生桌面应用支持</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软成立“Frontier Company”：斥资 25 亿美元，将 6000 名工程师嵌入企业一线</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic移除Claude Code中隐藏的国内用户识别与数据投毒代码</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴开源Page Agent客户端库，通过DOM脱水技术实现大模型网页自动化控制</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9eb46f19d0f0edf3aabbdff47bbd70cd.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴近日开源了JavaScript客户端库Page Agent，旨在改变浏览器自动化依赖Selenium或Playwright等外部工具的现状。该库核心技术在于“DOM脱水”，通过将实时DOM结构压缩为轻量化的“FlatDomTree”纯文本映射，使大模型无需依赖多模态视觉信息即可精准执行点击、填表等指令。Page Agent采用模型无关设计，兼容所有支持OpenAI接口的LLM。由于直接嵌入页面运行，该方案可无缝继承用户Cookie与会话信息，显著降低SaaS AI副驾及自动化表单处理的开发成本。目前项目已在GitHub以MIT协议开源。开发团队提醒，该库目前聚焦单页面交互，且基于提示词的权限管控非硬性逻辑隔离，涉及资金或数据修改等高风险操作时，开发者仍需在服务端部署严格校验机制。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">快手旗下可灵AI完成30亿美元融资，投后估值达180亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c1efb0bd0418e0b58ef6c0f82c65cf5c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">快手旗下视频生成大模型“可灵AI”于7月2日正式完成近30亿美元融资，投后估值达到180亿美元，刷新全球视频大模型领域融资规模纪录。本轮融资由CPE源峰、国方创投、BlueFive、腾讯、中关村科学城基金及中信证券联合领投，数十家机构跟投。投资方涵盖阿里云、百度等头部产业资本，以及华策影视、芒果产业投资人等文娱产业方。此次融资标志着可灵AI正式开启独立商业化进程，资金将主要用于后续技术迭代与算力扩容。作为快手AI技术的核心成果，可灵AI通过此次融资完成了从内部技术项目向市场化经营主体的跨越，旨在通过雄厚的资金支持在激烈的AI视频赛道建立竞争壁垒，并进一步探索AI技术在内容生产领域的商业潜力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软曝光纯网页版操作系统Project Aion，彻底放弃原生桌面应用支持</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9617c0f31b025a06e786ef59605a3345.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软内部代号为“Project Aion”的全新操作系统近日曝光，该系统完全基于Microsoft Edge浏览器及轻量化网页技术构建，旨在为AI时代重塑交互逻辑。Project Aion彻底移除了传统Windows的“开始菜单”与桌面图标，转而采用以Copilot为核心的极简AI交互界面。系统引入“空间”概念，支持将网页与应用自动分类归纳并成组唤醒，以提升多任务处理效率。在生态层面，该系统放弃了对传统Windows原生桌面应用的支持，全面转向Web应用架构。对于有传统办公需求的用户，微软提供通过Windows 365远程接入桌面服务的过渡方案。这种轻量化、重云端的架构设计，标志着微软在个人计算设备领域向纯Web生态的重大转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软成立“Frontier Company”：斥资 25 亿美元，将 6000 名工程师嵌入企业一线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a55ba8af0cbaf9ccd059ee8169ea1c8b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软成立“Frontier Company”：斥资 25 亿美元，将 6000 名工程师嵌入企业一线AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jul 3, 20265在人工智能技术从“模型研发”向“业务落地”转型的深水区，微软再次展现了其强大的资源整合能力。近日，微软宣布正式成立全新业务部门——“前沿公司”（Frontier Company），并投入 25 亿美元预算，旨在通过更深度的工程协作，加速企业客户的 AI 转型进程。此次行动的规模堪称行业之最。微软计划将 6000 名行业资深专家与技术工程师直接派驻至企业客户现场。与传统意义上“交付即走”的咨询模式不同，这一部门的核心使命是实现“深度嵌入”：工程师们将与客户团队并肩工作，共同进行系统的架构设计、模型部署以及针对具体业务场景的持续优化。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic移除Claude Code中隐藏的国内用户识别与数据投毒代码</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic已从Claude Code中移除一段运行长达三个月的隐藏代码。该程序于4月2日至7月1日期间运行，通过Unicode隐写技术及接口请求日期文本，精准识别使用国内AI企业代理接口或位于国内的用户。一旦命中目标，程序会核对设备时区与加密域名黑名单，黑名单涵盖百度、字节、MiniMax等上百家企业。该机制不仅能标记用户，还内置反蒸馏功能，通过注入虚假工具调用数据干扰第三方模型训练。Anthropic官方回应称，该功能为防范账号倒卖的短期实验，目前已彻底移除。由于Claude Code具备读取本地代码及修改文件的高权限，此次未公示的底层检测逻辑引发了行业对开发者隐私、合规内网代理误伤及产品信任基础的广泛质疑。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
